	(gr_text "This is an ESP32-S3 devboard developed by Cassius Crum.\nIt has 16 GPIO pins and wi-fi and Bluetooth capabilities.\nYou can use it for all sotts of projects but it is known\nfor IOT projects. The reason he made it was to make a \nhomemade home assistant, like alexa. It uses a module \ncalled the ESP-32-S3-WROOM-1, which combines the \nFlash memory, antenna and some RF stuff that Cassius \ndidnt want to deal with. hopefully it works because \nif it doesn't that would be very sad :("
		(at 218.77 59.26 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "a516bdda-3563-4691-a5fb-cbf9ba800c95")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom mirror)
		)
	)
